flowchart TB
    UI["Records + Meetings + Code 1.3.0-beta.1 candidate<br/>Typed desktop clients / authenticated loopback"]
    Domain["Python/FastAPI domain authority<br/>Records + Meetings + Code / Notice + Access"]
    State["PostgreSQL + local export files<br/>Audit history, canonical backup/restore"]
    Review["Changed response text → fresh human approval<br/>Failed generation / unrelated edits preserve approval"]
    Release["Approved export → fulfillment → public status<br/>No automatic release of AI drafts"]
    Runtime["Rust shell: OS integration and supervision<br/>Historical import/recovery retained; JSON actions retired"]
    Import["Explicit validated JSON import<br/>Old file read-only; no fallback or dual writes"]
    AI["Optional local Ollama / verified Gemma<br/>On-device drafting"]
    UI --> Domain
    Domain --> State
    Meetings["Meeting agendas and proceedings"] --> Decisions["Explicit adoption → separate codification"]
    Decisions --> Sources["Permitted current/historical Code and Meetings sources"]
    Sources --> Domain
    Import --> State
    Domain --> Review --> Release
    UI -. supervises .-> Runtime
    Domain -. optional generation .-> AI
